      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9571794::web::017::3_results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain and phase boundaries in a fine HEA structure impede dislocation motion and deformation transfer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9571794::web::017::3_results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The grain-boundary barrier effect limits plastic deformation during wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9571794::web::017::3_results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A stable nanocrystalline grain structure delays wear-induced grain coarsening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4510962::web::011::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A refined nanocrystalline structure delays crack propagation during wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A fine boundary-rich HEA microstructure contributes to improved wear resistance.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9571794::web::017::3_results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermally treated HEA coatings will have lower wear volume than otherwise identical as-deposited coatings.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermally treated HEA coatings will have higher hardness than otherwise identical as-deposited coatings.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermally treated coatings will retain a stable nanocrystalline structure observable by TEM or EBSD.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4510962::web::011::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermal treatment at moderate temperatures up to 300°C can promote recrystallization while avoiding excessive grain growth.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
